{
 "schema": "suborned.mission.adaptive/1",
 "mission": "handover",
 "id": "probe-rear-open",
 "style": "prepared-quiet",
 "note": "Motive scratch probe, brief 096 lend: the Enforcer holds Popovic in the bay after the Take (stand-in for the lent car leaving); the three open first on the posted crew at the Take end, blow the block with at most one left, board, Go (withdraw).",
